---
const phone = '010-0000-0000';
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="foot-grid">
      <div class="foot-brand">
        <div class="logo">
          <span class="logo-dot"></span>opsoult
        </div>
        <p>1인 매장부터 대형 프랜차이즈까지. 매장 운영에 필요한 모든 설비를 한 곳에서.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="foot-col">
        <h6>제품</h6>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/#products">카드단말기</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#products">포스기(POS)</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#products">키오스크</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#products">테이블오더</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#products">CCTV</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot-col">
        <h6>서비스</h6>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/#regions">지역별 설치</a></li>
          <li><a href="/blog">블로그</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#features">특장점</a></li>
          <li><a href="/#reviews">후기</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="foot-col">
        <h6>상담</h6>
        <ul>
          <li><a href={`tel:${phone}`}>📞 {phone}</a></li>
          <li>평일 09:00 ~ 21:00</li>
          <li>주말·공휴일 상담 가능</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="foot-bottom">
      <span>© {currentYear} opsoult. All rights reserved.</span>
      <span>opsoult.com</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: 60px 0 30px;
  }
  .foot-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .foot-brand .logo {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-weight: 800; font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    color: var(--paper);
  }
  .logo-dot {
    width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .foot-brand p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(245,241,234,0.6);
    margin-top: 12px;
    max-width: 280px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .foot-col h6 {
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-2);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .foot-col ul { list-style: none; }
  .foot-col li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: rgba(245,241,234,0.7);
  }
  .foot-col a:hover { color: var(--accent-2); }
  .foot-bottom {
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(245,241,234,0.1);
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(245,241,234,0.5);
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .foot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .foot-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .foot-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  }
</style>
